{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46845","headline":"寄萍乡唐禀正字 · 齐己","name":"寄萍乡唐禀正字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新书声价满皇都，高卧林中更起无。\n春兴酒香薰肺腑，夜吟云气湿髭须。\n同登水阁僧皆别，共上渔船鹤亦孤。\n长忆前年送行处，洞门残日照菖蒲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}